+# Gnome Archaeologist digging beside lichens
+
+The fallback engine lets a critically hurt Gnome Archaeologist resume digging
+from its own pit when the sole visible monster is a lichen beyond contact
+range. Recent damage, other monsters, and existing shelter conditions retain
+the original protection policy.
+
